ct, #2250).\n25\t   TIME claim LOCKED = **15–30 דקות / 15–30 minutes** (#2480) — warm \"coffee break\" framing, lighter/less\n26\t   intimidating. Replace the old 30–45 everywhere with 15–30.\n27\t2. **REMOVE status/owner chips** (\"● מוכן\" / \"👤 אתה עושה\") from every step head. (#2268)\n28\t3. **Step head structure** = H1 → teal lead one-liner (subtitle, NEW) → de-boxed \"מה קורה כאן\" eyebrow →\n29\t   tip. Trim duplicate body paragraph. (#2268)\n30\t4. **DE-BOX \"מה קורה כאן\"** → small teal eyebrow label (15/800) + plain 20px body, no card border.\n31\t   Reserve boxes ONLY for: tip, \"נתקעת?\", copy blocks, screenshots. (#2262/#2264)\n32\t5. **BREADCRUMB granular** → `phase / שלב N · <step title>`, current step named + highlighted. (#2248)\n33\t6. **BOTTOM NAV** — prev/next at the bottom of every step too (keep top back). (#2290/#2292)\n34\t7. **COPY BLOCKS** — every fixed/generic typed value → one-tap copy block (root, install one-liner,\n35\t   claude, diagnostic prompt, chmod, /exit, BotFather cmds, agent name). EXCEPTION: user's own secrets\n36\t   (root pw, their bot token, pairing code) stay manual. (#2244)\n37\t8. **EMOJI policy = NONE, everywhere (LOCKED #2480).** Zero emoji in titles/headings/prose/cards/markers.\n38\t   Replace legend/markers (🔵🔗📷🔴) + 💡 with clean classic on-brand glyphs/colored dots/CSS shapes +\n39\t   word \"טיפ\" with a teal bar. Goal = classic, clean, NOT gaudy (\"מצועצע\"), not AI-looking. Do NOT invest\n40\t   in bespoke custom icon art now (a later polish round may add designed icons). KEEP the \"✦ זה נשמע טכני\n41\t   אבל זה רק העתק-הדבק\" reassurance line on command steps (✦ is a typographic mark, fine).\n42\t9. **NanoClaw glossary** — add glossary term `nanoclaw` (open source / community / always-improving /\n43\t   free). Linkify EVERY occurrence of \"NanoClaw\" in body → glossary popover (not just first). (#2220 #2258)\n44\t9b. **NanoClaw community links-OUT block** (Elia's \"most important recommendation\", #2258) — a 