{"parentUuid":"1d8f921e-762d-4fb7-a2ca-fd3593dc28b0","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"file","filename":"/workspace/inbox/a2a-1781625715226-7db02b/_type_sample.html","content":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/inbox/a2a-1781625715226-7db02b/_type_sample.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"he\" dir=\"rtl\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>נסח טיפוגרפיה — מסך פנימי</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Heebo:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Baloo+2:wght@600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n:root{\n  --paper:#000000; --surface:#101010; --surface-2:#181818; --surface-3:#202020;\n  --ink:#FFFFFF; --ink-muted:#B0B0B0;\n  --teal:#56EDD6; --on-teal:#04211D; --line:#242424; --chip:#181818;\n  --sans:'Heebo','Inter',system-ui,sans-serif; --mono:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;\n  --round:'Baloo 2','Heebo',sans-serif;\n}\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\nbody{min-height:100vh;line-height:1.7;position:relative}\nbody::before{content:'';position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;background:radial-gradient(120% 80% at 50% -10%,rgba(86,237,214,.10),transparent 60%)}\na{color:#56EDD6;text-decoration:none}\n\n/* topbar */\n.topbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 34px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(0,0,0,.88);backdrop-filter:blur(14px)}\n.brand{font-family:var(--round);font-weight:800;font-size:20px}\n.brand .c{color:var(--teal)}\n.brand-by{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-top:1px}\n.top-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n.gbtn{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;background:var(--surface-2);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);border-radius:100px;padding:8px 16px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}\n.lang{display:flex;gap:2px}\n.lang button{background:transparent;color:var(--ink-muted);border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:100px}\n.lang button.on{background:var(--teal);color:var(--on-teal);font-weight:700}\n\n/* layout */\n.shell{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 312px;gap:54px;padding:48px 40px 90px}\n\n/* progress — now prominent */\n.progress-wrap{margin-bottom:44px}\n.progress-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:12px}\n.progress-meta .pc{font-size:17px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}\n.progress-meta .pp{font-size:19px;color:var(--teal);font-weight:800}\n.crumbs{font-size:16px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-bottom:18px}\n.crumbs .cur{color:var(--teal);font-weight:700}\n.crumbs .sep{opacity:.4;margin:0 6px}\n.progress-bar{height:6px;background:var(--surface-3);border-radius:100px;overflow:hidden}\n.progress-bar i{display:block;height:100%;width:14%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2bbfae,var(--teal));border-radius:100px}\n\n/* step head */\n.step-num{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:13px;background:var(--teal);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:15px;color:var(--on-teal);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:18px}\n.step-head h1{font-family:var(--round);font-size:48px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em;line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:12px}\n.lead{font-size:21px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink-muted);line-height:1.55;margin-bottom:30px}\n.lead b{color:var(--teal);font-weight:600}\n\n/* \"what\" intro — clean, no box (just an eyebrow label + text) */\n.what{margin:0 0 26px;padding:0}\n.what h5{font-size:15px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--teal);margin-bottom:10px;text-transform:uppercase}\n.what p{font-size:20px;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.78}\n.what p .lk{color:var(--teal);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(86,237,214,.45);font-weight:600}\n\n/* body text */\n.body p{font-size:20px;line-height:1.78;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-bottom:18px}\n.body p b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}\n\n/* tip — prominent now */\n.tip{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;margin:6px 0 0;padding:16px 20px;border-inline-start:4px solid var(--teal);background:var(--surface-2);border-radius:0 12px 12px 0}\n.tip .ic{color:var(--teal);font-size:20px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px}\n.tip p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--ink);font-weight:500}\n\n/* nav */\n.nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:46px}\n.btn{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:100px;cursor:pointer;border:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}\n.btn.prev{background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line)}\n.btn.next{background:var(--teal);color:var(--on-teal)}\n\n/* rail */\n.rail{border-inline-start:1px solid var(--line);padding-inline-start:28px}\n.rail-phase{margin-bottom:24px}\n.rail-phase>h4{font-size:19px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.01em;color:var(--teal);margin-bottom:12px}\n.rail-step{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--ink-muted);font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;cursor:pointer}\n.rail-step:hover{background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--ink)}\n.rail-step.active{background:var(--surface-3);color:var(--ink)}\n.rail-step .dot{flex:none;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-muted)}\n.rail-step.active .dot{border-color:var(--teal);color:var(--teal)}\n.rail-sec-head{font-size:14px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.03em;color:var(--ink-muted);margin:24px 0 10px 0;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.rail-guide{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--ink-muted);font-size:16px;cursor:pointer}\n.rail-guide:hover{background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--ink)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"topbar\">\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"brand\">Nano<span class=\"c\">Claw</span></div>\n    <div class=\"brand-by\">מאת אליה בן כנען · מדריך לא רשמי</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"top-right\">\n    <button class=\"gbtn\">📖 מילון</button>\n    <div class=\"lang\"><button class=\"on\">ע</button><button>EN</button></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"shell\">\n\n  <!-- MAIN -->\n  <main>\n    <div class=\"progress-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"crumbs\"><span>הכנה</span><span class=\"sep\">/</span><span class=\"cur\">שלב 2 · איפה הסוכן יחיה?</span></div>\n      <div class=\"progress-meta\"><span class=\"pp\">14%</span><span class=\"pc\">שלב 2 מתוך 8</span></div>\n      <div class=\"progress-bar\"><i></i></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step-num\">02</div>\n    <h1>איפה הסוכן יחיה?</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">בוחרים איפה הסוכן שלך יגור. <b>אני איתך, צעד אחר צעד.</b></p>\n\n    <div class=\"what\">\n      <h5>מה קורה כאן</h5>\n      <p>הסוכן שלך צריך לחיות על <span class=\"lk\">שרת ענן</span> או על המחשב שלך. ענן אומר שהוא דולק 24/7, רץ בסביבה מאובטחת ומבודדת, ואפשר לפנות אליו מהנייד או מכל מקום. כשהמחשב כבוי, גם הסוכן כבוי, ולכן במדריך הזה אנחנו הולכים על ענן.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tip\">\n      <span class=\"ic\">💡</span>\n      <p>טיפ: בשלב הבא נבחר את שרת הענן. חבילה סטנדרטית עובדת מצוין, והחיוב הישיר אליך מספק הענן.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nav\">\n      <button class=\"btn prev\">← הבא</button>\n      <button class=\"btn next\">הקודם →</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- RAIL -->\n  <aside class=\"rail\">\n    <div class=\"rail-phase\">\n      <h4>הכנה</h4>\n      <div class=\"rail-step\"><span class=\"dot\">1</span>מה מחכה לך כאן</div>\n      <div class=\"rail-step active\"><span class=\"dot\">2</span>איפה הסוכן יחיה?</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rail-phase\">\n      <h4>התקנה</h4>\n      <div class=\"rail-step\"><span class=\"dot\">3</span>הקמת שרת הענן</div>\n      <div class=\"rail-step\"><span class=\"dot\">4</span>מפתח ה-AI שלך</div>\n      <div class=\"rail-step\"><span class=\"dot\">5</span>מתקינים את הסוכן</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rail-phase\">\n      <h4>חיבור</h4>\n      <div class=\"rail-step\"><span class=\"dot\">6</span>חיבור אפליקציית הצ'אט</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rail-phase\">\n      <h4>הפעלה</h4>\n      <div class=\"rail-step\"><span class=\"dot\">7</span>תגיד שלום 👋</div>\n      <div class=\"rail-step\"><span class=\"dot\">8</span>היכרות ראשונה</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rail-sec-head\">חיבורים נוספים</div>\n    <div class=\"rail-guide\">אונקליי: הכספת שלך</div>\n    <div class=\"rail-guide\">חיבור WhatsApp</div>\n    <div class=\"rail-guide\">חיבור Gmail</div>\n    <div class=\"rail-guide\">חיבור Google Calendar</div>\n    <div class=\"rail-guide\">📖 מילון מונחים</div>\n  </aside>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n","numLines":166,"startLine":1,"totalLines":166}},"displayPath":"../inbox/a2a-1781625715226-7db02b/_type_sample.html"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"04a795ab-73f5-49a4-b07f-6e73ab1719c8","timestamp":"2026-06-16T16:58:33.072Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"/workspace/agent","sessionId":"b522cebd-0184-435d-9a0b-60eb7d0a73fa","version":"2.1.154","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"breezy-launching-scott"}
{"parentUuid":"04a795ab-73f5-49a4-b07f-6e73ab1719c8","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"compact_file_reference","filename":"/workspace/inbox/a2a-1781625714205-9e6uii/rail-demo.html","displayPath":"../inbox/a2a-1781625714205-9e6uii/rail-demo.html"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"280e2bcb-80a1-4383-9419-2ae175f0ebe4","timestamp":"2026-06-16T16:58:32.964Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"/workspace/agent","sessionId":"b522cebd-0184-435d-9a0b-60eb7d0a73fa","version":"2.1.154","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"breezy-launching-scott"}
{"parentUuid":"280e2bcb-80a1-4383-9419-2ae175f0ebe4","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"file","filename":"/workspace/inbox/a2a-1781625713179-868bjn/TYPE_SPEC_guide.md","content":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/inbox/a2a-1781625713179-868bjn/TYPE_SPEC_guide.md","content":"# מפרט פונטים — NanoClaw Guide (Jun 16, #2238-#2242)\n\nFormal type scale for the WHOLE guide. Goal: uniform, readable, clear hierarchy with MINOR\nsteps between levels (not tiny jumps). NO tiny text; NO low-contrast gray for readable content.\nEmbodied in `_type_sample.html` → type_sample_desktop.png (approved by Elia → apply globally).\n\n## Desktop scale (px / weight / line-height)\n| Role | Size | Weight | Color | Notes |\n|------|------|--------|-------|-------|\n| H1 — step title | 48 | 800 | #FFFFFF | Baloo 2 / Heebo |\n| H2 — sub-section (\"מה קורה כאן\", guide sub-heads) | 24 | 700 | #FFFFFF / teal label | minor step below H1, NOT tiny |\n| H3 — small label (chips, \"מה לעשות\") | 16 | 700 | brighter muted | uppercase-ish, letter-spacing |\n| Body / paragraph | 20 | 400 | #FFFFFF body, #C9C9C9 secondary | line-height 1.78 |\n| \"מה קורה כאן\" callout body | 20 | 400 | #FFFFFF | |\n| Tip 💡 | 18 | 500 | #FFFFFF | PROMINENT: teal 4px bar + bg; never gray-on-black tiny |\n| \"נתקעת?\" / stuck + ok hints | 17 | 500 | #FFFFFF (ok=teal) | was the worst offender — gray #B0B0B0 13px → now #FFFFFF/#C9C9C9 17px |\n| Progress \"14%\" | 19 | 800 | teal | prominent |\n| Progress \"שלב N מתוך 8\" | 17 | 600 | #FFFFFF | prominent |\n| Breadcrumb | 15 | 500/700cur | muted/teal | |\n| Rail phase headers (הכנה/התקנה) | 16 | 800 | teal | were 13, swallowed |\n| Rail step items | 17 | 500 | muted→ink | |\n| Code / commands (mono) | 16 | 500 | teal | one-tap copy |\n| Buttons | 16 | 700 | | |\n\n## Color floor (the gray problem)\n- Body/important text: **#FFFFFF**.\n- Secondary text: **#C9C9C9** (brighter than the old --ink-muted #B0B0B0) and NEVER below 17px.\n- `--ink-dim #6F6F6F` → DECORATIVE ONLY (footers, never readable content).\n- No readable sentence in gray-small. The \"לא רואה את ה-Droplet?...\" hint = #FFFFFF/17px going forward.\n\n## Hierarchy principle (Elia #2242)\n- Differences between H1 and sub-heads should be MINOR/graceful, not a cliff to tiny.\n- Ladder: 48 → 24 → 20 → 18 → 17. No jump straight from a big title to 12-13px.\n\n## Mobile\n- Scale ~88-92% via clamp; floors: body ≥17px, tips ≥16px, no text below 15px.\n\n## Apply\n- After Elia approves proportions → hand this spec + the sample to builder to retune ALL font-size\n  tokens in index.html (introduce CSS vars --fs-h1..--fs-tip for one source of truth), QA 402px + desktop.\n","numLines":41,"startLine":1,"totalLines":41}},"displayPath":"../inbox/a2a-1781625713179-868bjn/TYPE_SPEC_guide.md"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"ff3db2cc-bb78-4ece-ba78-60854739fe5b","timestamp":"2026-06-16T16:58:32.652Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"/workspace/agent","sessionId":"b522cebd-0184-435d-9a0b-60eb7d0a73fa","version":"2.1.154","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"breezy-launching-scott"}
