-pill big-letters; TEXT likely \"HE/EN\" Latin (CONFIRM with Elia — #2576 I'd recommended עב).\n   - **Logo on role pages is too small / out of proportion** → enlarge to proper size in the unified topbar.\n   - So unified topbar = logo RIGHT (proper size) + clean teal-pill toggle LEFT + mirror on switch. Need to standardize this single topbar component across index.html (picker), guide.html, all role pages + EN twins.\n\n5. **(#2586+#2588) Register screen copy** — DEFINITE: remove phone (= #3, confirmed again). PENDING (Elia thinking): register heading/wording — keep \"רגע, בוא נכיר\" OR adopt the role-page \"המדריך חי ומתעדכן / leave name+email for weekly updates, optional\" framing. My rec to offer: keep \"רגע, בוא נכיר\" + sub that gives the weekly-update reason (best of both). Await his call.\n\n**(#2590) PLACEMENT NOW LOCKED — blanket rule** (saved to CLAUDE.local.md): HE=logo right/toggle+מילון left; EN=mirrored. Reference = guide.html topbar. Uniform across ALL pages. Resolves placement part of #1. Toggle text still default עב unless Elia says HE.\n\n6. **(#2592) Make the heading \"רוצה שאכין עוד מדריך?\" TEAL** for prominence (card with \"אני מעדכן ומשפר את המדריכים... השאירו שם ומייל\"). Find element (likely role pages / finish). Consider applying teal to similar section headings for consistency.\n\n7. **(#2594+#2596) REORDER guide.html STEP 1 (\"מה מחכה לך כאן\") content** — better narrative rationale. New order top→bottom:\n   (a) FIRST: the concrete \"what we need / the steps we'll go through\" — lead with the requirements/journey (שרת בענן, Anthropic, אפליקציית הודעות, ~15–30 דק) = \"these are the steps we'll go through here.\" NOT the current soft/abstract opening (\"לא כמו שעשית פה\").\n   (b) THEN: the legend/מקרא card (\"איך עובדים עם המדריך\": מונח/קוד/קישור/צילום/נתקעת?).\n   (c) LAST (move DOWN to bottom): the \"מה זה NanoClaw / קוד פתוח / GitHub\" explanation block.\n   = engine-internal (STEPS[0] in guide.html) → likely hand to builder; I do cross-page edits.\n\n8. **(#2598) REMOVE two elements from guide.html step 1:** (a) the collapsible \"בדיקה מהירה לפני שמתחילים\" (precheck), (b) the red-flag trust note \"אין כאן שום דבר שאי אפשר לבטל: לא נשמרות סיסמאות, כל מפתח שלך, והכל רשום על שמך.\" Both add nothing. (Note: precheck was added long ago per #1456 — Elia now overrides, remove it.) Engine-internal → bundle with #7 for builder.\n\n9. **(#2602) SERVER step — add full provider comparison (RECURRING, now a HARD REQ in CLAUDE.local.md).** List all working providers (DigitalOcean/Hetzner/Hostinger/exe.dev) + each one's price (≥4GB tier, verify live) + what's needed (≥4GB RAM, not Google Cloud) + state guide focuses on OUR server (default DigitalOcean). Engine step 2/3.\n\n## Status: collecting more דגשים, not yet applied.\n## OPEN DECISIONS (Elia's): (a) toggle text עב vs HE Latin; (b) register copy wording.\n","numLines":39,"startLine":1,"totalLines":39}},"displayPath":"../inbox/a2a-1781640108975-1o5ehs/round2_master_brief_jun16.md"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"7a2dd9d9-0803-470c-832d-85c4ea7a5128","timestamp":"2026-06-16T20:49:15.753Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"/workspace/agent","sessionId":"b522cebd-0184-435d-9a0b-60eb7d0a73fa","version":"2.1.154","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"breezy-launching-scott"}
